Commercial</button>\n          <div class=\"mega-menu commercial-menu\">\n            <div><h2>Restaurant & Food Service</h2><a href=\"restaurant-plumbing.html\">Restaurant Plumbing</a><a href=\"commercial-kitchen-plumbing.html\">Commercial Kitchen Plumbing</a><a href=\"grease-trap-cleaning.html\">Grease Trap Cleaning</a><a href=\"grease-trap-installation.html\">Grease Trap Installation</a></div><div><h2>Property & General</h2><a href=\"commercial.html\">All Commercial Services</a><a href=\"maintenance-contracts.html\">Maintenance Contracts</a><a href=\"property-management-plumbing.html\">Property Management</a><a href=\"property-management-plumbing.html\">Strip Plaza Plumbing</a></div><div><h2>Inspections & Diagnostics</h2><a href=\"sewer-camera-inspection.html\">Sewage Line Inspection</a><a href=\"sewer-camera-inspection.html\">Video Camera Inspection</a><a href=\"commercial.html\">Industrial Plumbing</a></div><div><h2>Compliance & Safety</h2><a href=\"backflow-prevention.html\">Annual Inspections</a><a href=\"backflow-prevention.html\">Backflow Prevention</a><a href=\"commercial-emergency.html\">24/7 Commercial Emergency</a></div>\n            <div class=\"mega-cta\">\n              <h2>Commercial Service</h2>\n              <p>Restaurants, retail, condos and property managers. Same-day response across the GTA.</p>\n              <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:+16479809211\">647-980-9211</a>\n              <small>Get a free assessment</small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <a  href=\"blog.html\">Blog</a>\n        <a  href=\"about.html\">About</a>\n        <a  href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a class=\"call-link\" href=\"tel:+16479809211\">Call 647-980-9211</a>\n    </header>\n  \n    <main class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Commercial service</p>\n        <h1>Property management plumbing and electrical in Brampton</h1>\n        <p>Property management plumbing and electrical service in Brampton for condos, rentals, plazas, commercial units, tenant repairs, maintenance, and emergencies.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:+16479809211\">Call 647-980-9211</a>\n          <a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"contact.html\">Request commercial service</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <img class=\"page-hero-photo\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556911220-bff31c812dba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80\" alt=\"Commercial kitchen service consultation for plumbing and electrical work\" width=\"700\" height=\"460\">\n    </main>\n    \n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Local plumbing service</p>\n        <h2>What this service covers</h2>\n        <p>Fateh Plumbing & Electric helps homeowners and small businesses with property management plumbing and electrical in Brampton and nearby communities. This page is focused on property management plumbing in Brampton, so customers who need this exact service can find the right information quickly and move directly to a call or quote request.</p>\n        <p>A service call should feel clear from the first conversation. We ask what you are seeing, explain what may be urgent, and help you understand the next step before work begins.</p>\n        <p>Every job starts with the symptoms you can see: water on the floor, a fixture that keeps running, a drain that repeatedly backs up, a water heater that fails, or a pipe that has started to leak. From there, the goal is to protect the property, explain the repair options, and complete work that fits the building, budget, and timeline.</p>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"quick-card\">\n        <h2>Call for Property Management</h2>\n        <p>Tell us what is happening, where you are located, and whether water is actively leaking or backing up.</p>\n        <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:+16479809211\">Call 647-980-9211</a>\n        <a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"contact.html\">Request service</a>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"band two-column\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Common signs you need property management plumbing and electrical</h2>\n        <ul class=\"check-list\">\n          <li>tenant repair calls</li><li>multi-unit leaks</li><li>commercial unit maintenance</li><li>recurring drain issues</li><li>electrical repair requests</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2>What we can help with</h2>\n        <ul class=\"check-list\">\n          <li>tenant repair support</li><li>priority scheduling</li><li>plumbing and electrical repairs</li><li>maintenance recommendations</li><li>service documentation</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Clear service from first call to finished work</h2>\n        <p>When you call Fateh Plumbing & Electric, we start with the issue you can see and the risk you are worried about. From there, we help confirm whether the work is urgent, what information is useful, and what the technician may need to inspect on site.</p>\n        <p>The goal is simple: protect the property, explain the options clearly, and complete work that fits the home, business, budget, and timeline.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  \n    <section class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Related commercial services</p>\n        <h2>Commercial service paths</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"link-grid\">\n        <a href=\"commercial.html\"><span class=\"link-card-head\">\n    <span class=\"card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <path d=\"M6 3v8\"></path><path d=\"M10 3v8\"></path><path d=\"M6 7h4\"></path><path d=\"M8 11v10\"></path><path d=\"M16 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M16 3c3 2 3 6 0 8\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </span><strong>Restaurant & Food Service</strong></span><span>Restaurant Plumbing, Commercial Kitchen Plumbing, Grease Trap Cleaning, Grease Trap Installation</span></a><a href=\"commercial.html\"><span class=\"link-card-head\">\n    <span class=\"card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <path d=\"M3 21h18\"></path><path d=\"M6 21V7l6-4 6 4v14\"></path><path d=\"M9 21v-6h6v6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </span><strong>Property & General</strong></span><span>All Commercial Services, Maintenance Contracts, Property Management, Strip Plaza Plumbing</span></a><a href=\"commercial.html\"><span class=\"link-card-head\">\n    <span class=\"card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16 11l4-2v6l-4-2\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </span><strong>Inspections & Diagnostics</strong></span><span>Sewage Line Inspection, Video Camera Inspection, Industrial Plumbing</span></a><a href=\"commercial.html\"><span class=\"link-card-head\">\n    <span class=\"card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.1 8.8-7 10-3.9-1.2-7-5-7-10V6l7-3z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </span><strong>Compliance & Safety</strong></span><span>Annual Inspections, Backflow Prevention, 24/7 Commercial Emergency</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  \n    <section class=\"band faq\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Commercial FAQ</p>\n        <h2>Common questions about property management plumbing in Brampton</h2>\n      </div>\n      <details><summary>Do you provide property management plumbing in Brampton?</summary><p>Fateh Plumbing & Electric provides property management plumbing in Brampton and related plumbing services across Greater Toronto Area. Call 647-980-9211 to describe the issue and book a free on-sit